hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"334","Abu Musa reported that the Prophet"
"335","Ibrahim at-Taymi reported that his father said"
"336","Zayd ibn Aslam reported that his father heard 'Umar state"
"337","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"338","'A'isha said"
"339","Abu Ma'mar said"
"340","'Ata' ibn Abi Rabah reported that a man was praising another man\nin the presence of Ibn 'Umar. Ibn 'Umar began to throw dust towards his\nmouth. He said"
"341","Raja' said. """"One day Mihjan and I went to the mosque of the people\nof Basra. Burayda al-Aslami was sitting there by one of the mosque doors.\nInside the mosque there was a man called Sabka who used to make the prayers\nlong. We came to the mosque door which had a fringed woollen cloth over\nit. Now Burayda was someone who made jokes. He said"
"342","Al-Aswad ibn Suray' said"
"343","Abu Nujayd said"
"344","Ibn 'Awn reported"
